# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this workspace ships a binary, and the VHS
# reference images (V001) are only comparable if the build resolves identically.
/target

# Scratch output from manually running a tape at the top level of tapes/ (e.g.
# `vhs tapes/_dimensions.tape`) — GIF/PNG side effects of a probe or calibration
# run, not the committed references. Real per-screen references (V005) live
# under tapes/artifacts/ and are unaffected by this non-recursive pattern.
/tapes/*.gif
/tapes/*.png
